{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:123c9d86b35b66e6","name":"Razor Wire","source":{"id":"source:reference-123c9d86b35b66e6","title":"Razor Wire","revision":20930,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:49:41Z","sha256":"f7441e64900ce18ec75586d7f5cb9ca1800c4d3f4a6f44a7020f4b14cdfee1f2","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20930","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Razor%20Wire&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-123c9d86b35b66e6","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy at War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_at_War"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 10/Meter\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 2 Kilograms/Meter\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Restricted"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Restricted"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Razor Wire- strings of coiled wire festooned with razor-sharp metal- has been a battlefield staple for millennia. Although not impassable to well-equipped troopers, it still slows them down enough to make them vulnerable to other defenses, such as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Automated Sentry Guns"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Automated_Sentry_Guns"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Squares featuring Razor Wire are considered ",{"tag":"a","children":["Difficult Terrain"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Difficult_Terrain"},". When a target attempts to move through a square that contains Razor Wire, the wire makes a +10 attack, which is compared to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," of the target. If the attack succeeds, the target takes 2d6 damage and is ",{"tag":"a","children":["Immobilized"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Immobilized"},". If the attack misses, the target takes half damage and can move as normal. A target with the ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Evasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Evasion"}]}," Talent takes half damage if the attack succeeds or no damage if the attack misses.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Each square of Razor Wire has ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Reduction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Reduction"}," 1, 4 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"},", a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"}," of 20, and a Break DC of 30.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 2d6 (Slashing)\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Radius:"]}," N/A\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
